1
00:00:00,506 --> 00:00:04,096
(Amy:)He showed up in the middle of the night
with his bongos.

2
00:00:04,302 --> 00:00:07,842
l foolishly thought
it was some sort of musical booty call.

3
00:00:10,099 --> 00:00:13,599
(Leonard:)Poor guy.
He must have been exhausted.

4
00:00:13,811 --> 00:00:16,481
(Leonard:)Sheldon like to sleep
While Leonard play the bongo

5
00:00:20,068 --> 00:00:22,698
- That was kind of uncalled for.
- No, it was called for.

6
00:00:24,530 --> 00:00:25,570
(Sheldon:)What's going on?

7
00:00:25,782 --> 00:00:28,072
(Penny:)Sheldon, this craziness has gone
on long enough.

8
00:00:28,284 --> 00:00:30,324
(Penny:)Please come home
so I can cut your hair.

9
00:00:30,912 --> 00:00:33,872
(Sheldon:)Penny, you're not trained.
You're not licensed.

10
00:00:34,082 --> 00:00:37,962
And most importantly, you don't have
access to my haircut records.

11
00:00:41,005 --> 00:00:42,925
(Penny:)All right, honey, look...

12
00:00:43,132 --> 00:00:46,052
(Penny:)...we've known each other
for a long time now, right?

13
00:00:46,260 --> 00:00:49,930
l've taken you to Disneyland,
l kicked a bully in the nuts for you.

14
00:00:51,057 --> 00:00:55,517
l sing you "Soft Kitty" when you're sick,
you've even seen me naked once.

15
00:00:55,728 --> 00:00:59,018
I'm sorry, what?

